600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099090/extras/dd368f040ab554f5cbf52d03a9c9e78b.webm?t=1733030997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099090/extras/dd368f040ab554f5cbf52d03a9c9e78b.mp4?t=1733030997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don't let the enemies get to close to your fish. Else your fish will get eaten setting you back on your mission to collecting the <strong>egg</strong>.</li></ul>",
